{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the nightmare with the free demo of <i>Cursed Presence</i>,</strong> a first-person psychological horror experience that showcases the game\u2019s opening two levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin inside the protagonist\u2019s home\u2014a place filled with memories and dark family secrets. Witness <strong>terrifying paranormal events, unsettling revelations about Frank\u2019s destiny,</strong> and the first hints of his struggle against malevolent spirits. Every room hides clues about the haunting forces that follow him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0<strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Immerse yourself in dark, detailed environments designed to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0<strong>Supernatural Encounters:</strong> Spirits and ghostly presences that challenge your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0<strong>Puzzles &amp; Revelations:</strong> Solve story-driven puzzles that connect Frank\u2019s past to the world of the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0<strong>An Unsettling Narrative:</strong> A tale of grief, guilt, and family secrets slowly brought to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the bell and fase the unknown?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051740?t=1759469048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051740/77ca67b908e8cddaf0bbaaf21bd134b70f8a4ffb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759469048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051740/ccd3b3522c7ca63e9193069865b51407e51b651d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759469048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051740/ccd3b3522c7ca63e9193069865b51407e51b651d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759